#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise 1a"
msgstr "Exercise 1a"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:74 capture.en.adoc:47 management.en.adoc:28
#: publishing.en.adoc:46
msgid "Read <<scenario,USE CASE I>> (if you haven't already)."
msgstr "請看 <<練習案例一：情境>> (若您還沒閱讀過的話)"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:78
msgid "Using the cards select the goals that mostly closely match those the project outlines and then choose the tasks that would need to be carried out to complete them.  Next, identify the people/resources that the project has available to it and assign role cards to them as appropriate.  Lastly, assign these to their stakeholder groups and affiliations."
msgstr "透過卡牌選出最符合此專案大綱的的目標(goal)，接著選出需要進行的任務目標(task)。接下來，確定專案中可用的參與者、資源，並分配適合的角色卡給他們。最後，將這些分派給他們的利害關係人群體、隸屬關係上。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:80
msgid "Review the GOALS cards with the group, select and lay out the ones that fit the use case."
msgstr "一同查看目標卡(GOALS)，選擇並將適合於案例情境的目標卡放入其中。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:81
msgid "Review the TASK cards with the group."
msgstr "查看任務卡(TASK)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:82
msgid "Assign the TASK cards to each of the GOAL cards selected from the use case description."
msgstr "將任務卡指定到每個目標卡底下。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:83
msgid "Identify the institutions and people mentioned in the use case text and make note of them."
msgstr "辨別出在案例中提到的機構、人物，並記下他們。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:84
msgid "Lay out the AFFILIATIONS cards on the table."
msgstr "翻開隸屬關係卡(AFFILIATIONS)，並擺在桌上。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:85
msgid "Review the STAKEHOLDER cards, identify any mentioned in the use case and then decide which AFFILIATION they belong to."
msgstr "查看利害關係人卡(STAKEHOLDER)，辨別在本次案例中提到者，而後決定他們的隸屬關係(AFFILIATION)"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:86
msgid "Review the ROLE cards, identify any mentioned in the use case and decide which STAKEHOLDER group they belong to."
msgstr "查看角色卡(ROLE)，找出案例中提到者，並決定各個利害關係人(STAKEHOLDER)屬於何種角色。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:87
msgid "Make notes to cards as appropriate."
msgstr "根據需要在卡片上做記錄。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:88
msgid "Once the cards are assigned take pictures/screenshots."
msgstr "一旦分配了卡片，就拍照/截圖。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:89
msgid "Use the <<exercise-sheet,exercise sheet>> to provide your answers."
msgstr "用 <<exercise-sheet,exercise sheet>> 來提供你的答案"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:92
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Question*\n"
msgstr "*問題*\n"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:94
msgid "Are there resources or goals missing from the cards that you feel are critical to the successful completion of the project? Note these on the answer sheet."
msgstr "是否有你認為對於完成專案至關重要，但卡片中遺漏的資源、目標呢？若有，請記在答案紙(answer sheet)上。"

