msgid "Exercise 1b"
msgstr "Exercise 1b"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:99
msgid "Using the stakeholder and goal analysis from exercise 1a, develop a workflow using the STAGE cards."
msgstr "根據exercise 1a的利害關係人、目標分析，用工作階段卡(STAGE)來發展工作流。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:101
msgid "Re-read the use case introduction, if necessary."
msgstr "如果需要，可以重讀一次案例介紹。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:102
msgid "Decide which TASKS for which each ROLE will be responsible."
msgstr "決定每個任務(TASK)該由哪個角色(ROLE)負責。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:103
msgid "Review the STAGE cards and order the TASKS appropriately."
msgstr "查看工作階段卡(STAGE)，並適當地安排任務(TASK)。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:104 capture.en.adoc:56 management.en.adoc:44
#: management.en.adoc:70 management.en.adoc:87 publishing.en.adoc:56
msgid "Use the previously downloaded exercise sheet to provide your answers."
msgstr "使用前面下載的練習表exercise sheet 來提供你的答案。"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:107
#, no-wrap
msgid "*Questions*   \n"
msgstr "*問題*\n"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:110
msgid "Are there obvious bottlenecks in the workflow? For example: Are there too many tasks for a particular role/resource?"
msgstr "工作流中有明顯的瓶頸嗎？如：有特定的角色/資源負擔了太多的任務嗎？"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:112
msgid "What issues do you think would be important to the successful mobilization of data from the points of view of each stakeholder/role? For example: What are the deliverables? Thinking about the general project timeframe, are they realistic?"
msgstr "以各個利害關係人、角色的角度來看，哪些問題對成功的資料數位化來說是重要的呢？如：什麼是實際可交付的結果？以整體專案的時間表來說，他們是可行的嗎？"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:113
msgid "Consolidate notes and prioritize in order of importance."
msgstr "請整理好筆記，並照重要順序排好"

#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:114
msgid "If you have time you can explore different combinations as different scenarios are possible in different contexts or even try to document the situation for your own project."
msgstr "如果有時間，你可以探索不同的組合，因為在不同的上下文中可能出現不同的場景，或甚至可以用自己專案的情況來做嘗試。"

#. type: Title ====
#: planning.en.adoc:116
#, no-wrap
msgid "Exercise 1c"
msgstr "Exercise 1c"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:119
msgid "This exercise should be used when the course is taught virtually or onsite as a group activity."
msgstr "此練習應於課程以線上或現場小組活動形式進行時使用。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:121
msgid "After the exercises the presenter of each group will:"
msgstr "在這些練習後，各組的報告者將："

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:123
msgid "Present any missing stakeholders and/or tasks saying why they were added."
msgstr "補上此處缺少的利害關係人、任務，並說明應該被加入的理由。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:124
msgid "Highlight the two most critical issues/topics that the group has identified."
msgstr "呈現兩個在小組內已找出最重要的議題/主題。"

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:126
msgid "Potential discussion points across groups:"
msgstr "各組間可討論的方向："

#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:128
