#. type: Title ===
#: planning.en.adoc:130 capture.en.adoc:59 management.en.adoc:146
#: publishing.en.adoc:57
#, no-wrap
msgid "Review"
msgstr "複習回顧"

#.  Note the lack of empty lines between the end of the question (....) and the start of the next question
#.  (. What…) is required, so I have added // comments to help separate them.
#.  The + connects the question into the numbered list item, see https://docs.asciidoctor.org/asciidoc/latest/lists/continuation/
#.  Question 1
#. type: delimited block *
#: planning.en.adoc:142
msgid "What is the order of the five PMBoK Process Groupings?"
msgstr "PMBoK (Project Management Body of Knowledge, 專案知識管理流程群組)的五個步驟為何呢？"

#. type: delimited block .
#: planning.en.adoc:150
#, no-wrap
msgid "- [ ] Planning, Initiating, Monitoring and Controlling, Executing, Closing\n"
"- [x] Initiating, Planning, Executing, Monitoring and Controlling, Closing\n"
"- [ ] Initiating, Planning, Executing, Closing, Monitoring and Controlling\n"
"- [ ] Initiating, Planning, Monitoring and Controlling, Executing, Closing\n"
msgstr "- [ ] 規劃(Planning), 起始(Initiating), 監視與管制(Monitoring and Controlling), 執行(Executing), 結束(Closing)\n"
"- [x] 起始(Initiating), 規劃(Planning), 執行(Executing), 監視與管制(Monitoring and Controlling), 結束(Closing)\n"
"- [ ] 起始(Initiating), 規劃(Planning), 執行(Executing), 結束(Closing), 監視與管制(Monitoring and Controlling)\n"
"- [ ] 起始(Initiating), 規劃(Planning), 監視與管制(Monitoring and Controlling), 執行(Executing), 結束(Closing)\n"

#.  Question 2
#. type: Plain text
#: planning.en.adoc:153
msgid "What are the types of deliverables? (multiple correct answers)"
msgstr "所謂可交付的成果有哪些種類？(有數個正確答案)"

#. type: delimited block .
#: planning.en.adoc:162
