"- [x] Implied\n"
"- [ ] Estimated\n"
"- [x] Direct\n"
"- [x] Indirect\n"
"- [ ] Guesses\n"
msgstr "- [x] 可被呈述的Stated\n"
"- [x] 隱含的Implied\n"
"- [ ] 被估計的Estimated\n"
"- [x] 直接的Direct\n"
"- [x] 間接的Indirect\n"
"- [ ] 被推測的Guesses\n"

