msgid "Pay extra summer interns to work at the local ISC to coordinate surveys ."
msgstr "聘請額外的暑期實習生在當地 ISC工作，協助協調問卷調查。"

#. type: Plain text
#: use-case-invasive-species.en.adoc:84
msgid "Offer financial support to BIISC to set up websites for each new school."
