msgstr "有兩個選項（《use-case-ii-invasive-species，入侵物種》 或《use-case-ii-lepidoptera-sightings，鱗翅目目擊》）。你只需要選擇其中之一完成作業。"

#. type: Plain text
#: assignments.en.adoc:11 assignments.en.adoc:20
msgid "Required files for submission:"
msgstr "需要繳交的檔案："

#. type: Plain text
#: assignments.en.adoc:13 assignments.en.adoc:22
